{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526560/extras/Dwarfsnnn.png?t=1749584066\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526560/extras/Dwarfshow-export.gif?t=1749584066\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u00a0 </i>Dwarfs are base trops\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Ranged &amp; Non-Ranged</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Magical &amp; Non-Magical</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526560/extras/elfsnnn.png?t=1749584066\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526560/extras/elfshow-export.gif?t=1749584066\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ranged Damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Great Damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No Magical Damage</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526560/extras/granharsnnn.png?t=1749584066\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526560/extras/granharshow-export.gif?t=1749584066\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Granhars Don't deal that much damage directly instead they put enemies into fire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">High Fire Resistance\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lot's Of Fire Damage</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526560/extras/orcsnnn.png?t=1749584066\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526560/extras/orcsshow_export.gif?t=1749584066\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have Variations, High HP Fire Resistance etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526560/extras/Itemsnnn.png?t=1749584066\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526560/extras/itemshow.png?t=1749584066\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gives abilities &amp; boost to units</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lost all items when unit deaths</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526560/extras/Towersnnn.png?t=1749584066\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526560/extras/towersshow-export.gif?t=1749584066\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have variations\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some of them are supportive &amp; for resources some of them attack to enemy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you select a race you can use their towers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are base towers for dwarves\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526560/extras/Towerdefensennn.png?t=1749584066\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PLACEMENT</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are able to place dwarfs on the paths and buildings on the sides of paths</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>LEVELS</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dwarfs level up automatically, enemies level up by wave and you need to upgrade your buildings to get more resources\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>VILLAGE</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You need to work on the &quot;Dwarven Village&quot; by placing &amp; repairing &amp; upgrading towers to get bonus stats &amp; spells</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GETTING HELP FROM DIFFERENT RACES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you repair the watchtower in the village you are able to select one race and get help from them by being able to place them on paths &amp; being able to place special towers that belongs to that race.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>INCREASE YOUR STATS BY BUYING &amp; UPGRADING TOWERS\u00a0</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can increase your stats by buying &amp; upgrading towers &amp; statues \u00a0or with cards</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3526560?t=1749584066","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526560/e385a131ba6bae0119d9afa78965ced831ba1a71/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749584066","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526560/be771a1f2423db0a1354eaf32105efbdd9aa87bd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749584066","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526560/be771a1f2423db0a1354eaf32105efbdd9aa87bd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749584066","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_pa